        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draft Day Sports: College Football 26</i> puts you in the ultimate coaching role—where building a powerhouse is more than just Xs and Os. Recruit the next generation of stars, call the shots on game day, and construct your own custom playbooks and plays to match your unique philosophy. Manage your roster, develop your players, and chase glory season after season in a deep and immersive dynasty mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to this year’s game is the ability to begin your coaching career as a <strong>coordinator</strong>, letting you work your way up to head coach as you earn promotions and reputation. <strong>Team cohesion</strong> now plays a critical role in how your players execute on the field, making leadership, chemistry, and consistency more important than ever. Analyze your success like never before with expanded <strong>play analysis tools</strong> that let you dive deep into which plays are truly making an impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smarter competition awaits, as <strong>AI-controlled teams dynamically adapt</strong> their playbooks throughout the season based on what’s working both for them and around the league. Experience games with a new level of visual immersion thanks to our <strong>animated figures game view</strong>, and explore different styles of college football by choosing between <strong>different league styles</strong>. Whether you're building a new dynasty from scratch or stepping into the shoes of a legendary coach, <i>DDS: College Football 26</i> delivers the strategy, customization, and challenge that make college football so special.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draft Day Sports: College Football 26</i> puts you in the ultimate coaching role—where building a powerhouse is more than just Xs and Os. Recruit the next generation of stars, call the shots on game day, and construct your own custom playbooks and plays to match your unique philosophy. Manage your roster, develop your players, and chase glory season after season in a deep and immersive dynasty mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to this year’s game is the ability to begin your coaching career as a <strong>coordinator</strong>, letting you work your way up to head coach as you earn promotions and reputation. <strong>Team cohesion</strong> now plays a critical role in how your players execute on the field, making leadership, chemistry, and consistency more important than ever. Analyze your success like never before with expanded <strong>play analysis tools</strong> that let you dive deep into which plays are truly making an impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smarter competition awaits, as <strong>AI-controlled teams dynamically adapt</strong> their playbooks throughout the season based on what’s working both for them and around the league. Experience games with a new level of visual immersion thanks to our <strong>animated figures game view</strong>, and explore different styles of college football by choosing between <strong>different league styles</strong>. Whether you're building a new dynasty from scratch or stepping into the shoes of a legendary coach, <i>DDS: College Football 26</i> delivers the strategy, customization, and challenge that make college football so special.</p>",
        "short_description": "Start as a coordinator and rise to head coach in Draft Day Sports: College Football 26! Build playbooks, recruit stars, manage team cohesion, and outsmart adaptive AI. Create your dynasty with unmatched depth and strategy.",
